voice": "", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "290112": {"id": 290112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|Type64-AR|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"290101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "290102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "290103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "290104": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "PHRASE", "caption": "Huh? Me?"}, "290105": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "Am I bothered by anything? No, not really. I was just thinking about some meaningless things... I-I didn't expect you to be so concerned about others."}, "290106": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "Alright, alright, you win. Please don't stare at me like that. You're making me all embarrassed..."}, "290107": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "I don't think that Doll has talked with me before, even though we've seen each other around... Forget it, if I take the initiative, it'll feel like I've lost."}, "290108": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "NEWYEAR", "caption": "Happy New Year, Commander... Oh, this? This is soba, one of the few dishes I can make. Would you like to try some?"}, "290109": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Is this the location of our next date? I've never heard of it before...but since you chose it, I have nothing to fear."}, "290110": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "Commander, there are still too many things in this world which are \"unknown\" to me.<>Facing the \"unknown\" terrifies me, but as long as you're around...<>No, it's nothing. What I mean is, please don't cast me aside."}, "290111": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "290112": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Huh? When did you show up?"}}}